    <!-- ⚠️ This block used to also claim that "no physical navigation keys" was
         an AOSP default needing no entry. That reasoning was backwards and
         would have shipped an unnavigable device.

         AOSP's default is false (frameworks/base/core/res/res/values/config.xml
         :2771), and DisplayPolicy.java:677-688 reads it to decide whether
         SystemUI creates a NavigationBar at all. false means no Home/Back/
         Recents AND no edge-back gesture handler.

